   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Consider Sternberg’s triangular theory of love, which identifies intimacy, passion, and commitment as key components of relationships. Reflect on a relationship you’ve observed (it could be a relative, friend, or public figure) and analyze how these three components are balanced or unbalanced in that relationship. How do you think this balance impacts their overall satisfaction?",
